---
title: "withdraw (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: validate_market + ensure_version_matches
    q_validate --> q_check_circuit: assert !circuit_break_triggered
    q_check_circuit --> q_check_amount: assert ctoken_amount != 0
    q_check_amount --> q_check_pause: assert !withdraw_paused
    q_check_pause --> q_check_obligation: assert obligation.market_id matches
    q_check_obligation --> q_refresh_interest: refresh_obligation_assets_interest(all debts + collaterals, now)
    q_refresh_interest --> q_withdraw_ctokens: ctoken = obligation.withdraw_ctokens(amount)
    q_withdraw_ctokens --> q_safety_check: is_obligation_safe check
    q_safety_check --> q_safe: obligation is safe
    q_safety_check --> q_error: abort obligation_not_safe
    q_safe --> q_burn: reserve.burn_ctokens(ctoken)
    q_burn --> q_rate_limit: emode.deposit_limiter.add_outflow(now, withdraw_amount)
    q_rate_limit --> q_try_stop_adl: try_stop_collateral_deleverage(total_deposit)
    q_try_stop_adl --> q_update_mining: update_obligation_reward_manager(deposit_type)
    q_update_mining --> q_emit: emit WithdrawEvent
    q_emit --> q_transfer: transfer coin to sender
    q_transfer --> [*]
    q_error --> [*]

    note right of q_safety_check
        INV-001: weighted_debts_value_usd must be lte collateral_value_usd after withdraw
        INV-002: EMA-spot price difference must be within tolerance (default 10%)
        INV-003: withdraw_amount = exchange_rate * ctoken_amount
        INV-004: rate limiter enforces per-cycle deposit outflow limits
    end note
